  <h2>8. International Data Transfer</h2>
  <p>Your data is stored on <strong>Scaleway servers in Paris (France)</strong>. This international transfer is governed by <strong>GDPR</strong> and <strong>Moroccan Law 09-08</strong>. We ensure it is <strong>protected</strong> by data processing agreements with Scaleway.</p>

